  "boundary": "Stock public WSGI API, SQLite, worker task entry points, actual Amphora agent Flask routes and upload/reload logic, and real Linux HAProxy. In-process transport and loopback model mTLS, Amphora network namespace and VIP advertisement. Local service code runs the generated HAProxy commands and checks readiness instead of invoking the systemd manager. The cold mode models the repository callback's SIGTERM then -D transition. A Linux user namespace maps the scratch runner to nobody so the stock provider render can run unchanged.",
